OL,3,GNEWSAMotion to limit length of Budget
OL,4,Adebate speeches
OL,5,
OL,6,FMoves are being made to limit the
OL,7,Flength of speeches in the States'
OL,8,FBudget debate.
OL,10,FThere are 30 amendments lodged for the
OL,11,Fdebate which is due to take place from
OL,12,F3 November, which include increasing
OL,13,Fsocial housing spending and free bus
OL,14,Ftravel.
OL,16,FThe Policy and Resources Committee has
OL,17,Flaid out a motion to limit speeches to
OL,18,Feither seven and a half minutes for
OL,19,Fopening speeches and five minutes for
OL,20,Fdebates, or nine minutes for opening
OL,21,Fspeeches and six minutes for debates.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
