OL,3,GNEWSAMotion to limit length of Budget
OL,4,Adebate speeches
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeeches were limited during the
OL,7,FStates' tax debate at the start of
OL,8,FOctober, a change several politicians
OL,9,Flater credited with helping the
OL,10,Fassembly complete the debate within six
OL,11,Fdays.
